  "narrative": {
    "overview": "This is an extraction of the existing application and its November 2026 refinement, not a replacement identity. Warm paper surfaces, violet actions, sage status accents, and serif manuscript text remain shared across the app and website. The user's constraint is to retain these colors while making both surfaces feel less generic and preserving their workflows.\n\nThe workspace gives the draft priority through continuous navigation, quieter toolbars, readable rows, and open context sections. The website uses the same materials at a larger reading scale. Its particular manuscript-spread composition is documented in `src/features/website/README.md`; it is not a required layout for future app screens. No new brand metaphor or product positioning is established here.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Warm neutral surfaces with restrained violet and sage accents.",
      "Serif manuscript and story titles; familiar sans-serif controls.",
